      "body": [
        {
          "component": "rich_text",
          "content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Wandering through ARoS Aarhus Art Museum's five galleries, I stumbled upon a world of artistic wonders. From historical masterpieces to mind-bending installations, this Danish gem has ignited my creative spark."
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ARoS is an art museum in Aarhus, Denmark. The museum was established in 1859 and is the oldest public art museum in Denmark outside Copenhagen. With five galleries and an entire floor dedicated to installation art, ARoS offers an important free space where it is possible to understand the past, explore the present and imagine the future in completely new ways."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "While at ARoS, I learnt some tips and tricks that are relevant to my media and artistic practice. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "When curating and producing an art exhibition, drawing inspiration from industry standard and practices is key to highlighting how African curators and producers can learn and adapt to showcase their art products in an immersive way:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "ordered_list",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": ": The ARoS exhibition focuses on creating immersive environments that transport viewers into the artwork's world. African curators can consider:"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": ": The ARoS exhibition leverages technology to create interactive experiences. African curators can explore:"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": ": The ARoS exhibition blended art forms, creating unique and thought-provoking experiences. African curators can consider:"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": ": The ARoS exhibition prioritized public engagement through educational programs and workshops. African curators can:"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": ": The ARoS exhibition challenged traditional gallery settings. African curators can:"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": ": The ARoS exhibition strived to be accessible to all visitors. African curators can:"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": ": The ARoS exhibition showcased emerging artists and support local craftsmanship. African curators can:"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": ": The ARoS exhibition had a strong emphasis on documentation and archiving. African curators can:"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Incorporating these tips can support African curators and producers in creating dynamic, engaging, and culturally relevant art exhibitions that resonate with both local and international audiences."
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
